tee - copy standard input to multiple outputs

SYNOPSIS
    tee [-a] [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Copy standard input to standard output and to each named file. Existing
    files are truncated by default. Use -a to append to them.

EXAMPLES
    ls -l | tee /tmp/listing

SEE ALSO
    cat(1), sh(1)
